#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:242
msgid "Require CVV at the ticket scanner"
msgstr "Exigir CVV no leitor de bilhetes"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:243
msgid ""
"If active, a CVV is auto-generated for every new ticket on this product, and "
"the ticket scanner asks the customer to enter the CVV before redeem. The CVV "
"is delivered via the order email and customer profile, never embedded in the "
"QR code. Best for private/exclusive events where a lost ticket card alone "
"must not grant entry."
msgstr ""

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:272
msgid "Assign a seating plan to this ticket product."
msgstr "Atribuir um plano de lugares a este produto de bilhete."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:284
msgid ""
"This seating plan has not been published yet. Customers will not see a seat "
"selection until you publish the plan."
msgstr ""
"Este plano de lugares ainda nao foi publicado. Os clientes nao verao a "
"selecao de lugares ate que publique o plano."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:285
msgid "Go to Seating Plans"
msgstr "Ir para Planos de Lugares"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:311
msgid "Seat Selection Required"
msgstr "Selecao de Lugar Obrigatoria"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:312
msgid ""
"If enabled: Customer must select a seat before adding to cart (e.g., theater "
"with numbered seats). If disabled: Seat selection is optional (e.g., "
"festival with VIP seats + standing area)."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado: O cliente deve selecionar um lugar antes de adicionar ao "
"carrinho (ex.: teatro com lugares numerados). Se desativado: A selecao de "
"lugar e opcional (ex.: festival com lugares VIP + zona em pe)."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:317
msgid "No seating plans available."
msgstr "Nenhum plano de lugares disponivel."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:319
msgid "Create one first"
msgstr "Crie um primeiro"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:330
msgid "This will be also in the cal entry file."
msgstr "Isto também será incluído no ficheiro de calendário."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:336
#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:800
msgid "Start date event"
msgstr "Data de início do evento"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:339
#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:803
msgid ""
"Set this to have this printed on the ticket and prevent too early redeemed "
"tickets. Tickets can be redeemed from that day on."
msgstr ""
"Defina isto para que seja impresso no bilhete e para impedir validações "
"antecipadas. Os bilhetes podem ser validados a partir desse dia."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:345
#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:809
msgid "Start time"
msgstr "Hora de início"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:347
#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:364
#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:811
#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:828
msgid "Set this to have this printed on the ticket."
msgstr "Defina isto para que seja impresso no bilhete."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:353
#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:817
msgid "End date event"
msgstr "Data de fim do evento"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:356
#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:820
msgid ""
"Set this to have this printed on the ticket and prevent later the ticket to "
"be still valid. Tickets cannot be redeemed after that day."
msgstr ""
"Defina isto para que seja impresso no bilhete e para impedir que o bilhete "
"continue válido após esta data. O bilhete será apresentado como expirado."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:362
#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:826
msgid "End time"
msgstr "Hora de fim"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:371
msgid "Date is for all variants"
msgstr "A data aplica-se a todas as variantes"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:372
msgid ""
"Activate this, to have the entered date printed on all product variants. No "
"effect on simple products."
msgstr ""
"Ative isto para que a data introduzida seja impressa em todas as variantes "
"do produto. Sem efeito em produtos simples."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:383
msgid "Customer can choose the day"
msgstr "O cliente pode escolher o dia"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:384
msgid ""
"Activate this, to allow your customer to choose a date. If this option is "
"active it will use the start and end date as limits, if provided. And use "
"only the start and end time setting. If the start and end time is not set, "
"then the entrance is allowed from 00:00 till 23:59."
msgstr ""
"Ative esta opcao para permitir que o seu cliente escolha uma data. Se esta "
"opcao estiver ativa, utilizara as datas de inicio e fim como limites, se "
"fornecidas. E utilizara apenas as definicoes de hora de inicio e fim. Se a "
"hora de inicio e fim nao estiver definida, a entrada sera permitida das "
"00:00 ate as 23:59."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:389
msgid "Only one date picker"
msgstr "Apenas um seletor de data"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:390
msgid ""
"If this option is active, then only one date is allowed per purchase of this "
"product. If your customer buys 2 or more of this ticket, than only one date "
"picker will be shown for all the tickets. The default is to display for each "
"product in the cart one separated date picker."
msgstr ""
"Se esta opcao estiver ativa, apenas uma data e permitida por compra deste "
"produto. Se o seu cliente comprar 2 ou mais deste bilhete, apenas um seletor "
"de data sera apresentado para todos os bilhetes. O padrao e apresentar um "
"seletor de data separado para cada produto no carrinho."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:397
msgid "Choose which days to exclude"
msgstr "Escolha quais dias excluir"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:398
msgid ""
"To select more than one, hold down the CTRL key. The selected days cannot be "
"choosen by your customer in date chooser."
msgstr ""
"Para selecionar mais do que um, mantenha premida a tecla CTRL. Os dias "
"selecionados nao podem ser escolhidos pelo seu cliente no seletor de datas."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:402
msgid "Monday"
msgstr "Segunda-feira"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:403
msgid "Tuesday"
msgstr "Terca-feira"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:404
msgid "Wednesday"
msgstr "Quarta-feira"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:405
msgid "Thursday"
msgstr "Quinta-feira"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:406
msgid "Friday"
msgstr "Sexta-feira"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:407
msgid "Saturday"
msgstr "Sabado"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:408
msgid "Sunday"
msgstr "Domingo"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:416
msgid "Offset days for start date"
msgstr "Dias de desfasamento para a data de inicio"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:419
msgid ""
"This will set how many days to skip before you allow your customer to choose "
"a date. 0 means starting from the same day, 1 means from tomorrow on and so "
"on. If you set a start date, the the start date will be considered as a "
"minimum starting date."
msgstr ""
"Isto define quantos dias a saltar antes de permitir ao seu cliente escolher "
"uma data. 0 significa a partir do mesmo dia, 1 significa a partir de amanha "
"e assim por diante. Se definir uma data de inicio, a data de inicio sera "
"considerada como data minima de inicio."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:426
msgid "Offset days for end date"
msgstr "Dias de desfasamento para a data de fim"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:429
msgid ""
"This will set how many days in the future do you allow your customer to "
"choose a date. 0 unlimited into the future, 1 means until tomorrow on and so "
"on. If a end date is set, then this option is ignored and the end date is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Isto define quantos dias no futuro permite ao seu cliente escolher uma data. "
"0 significa ilimitado no futuro, 1 significa ate amanha e assim por diante. "
"Se uma data de fim estiver definida, esta opcao e ignorada e a data de fim e "
"utilizada."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:435
msgid "Same-day cutoff time"
msgstr "Hora limite no próprio dia"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:437
msgid ""
"If the current time is past this value, today will no longer be selectable. "
"Only applies when \"Offset days for start date\" is 0. Leave empty to "
"disable."
msgstr ""

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:444
msgid "Label for the date picker"
msgstr "Etiqueta para o seletor de data"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:445
#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:544
msgid "This is how your customer understand what value should be choosen."
msgstr "E assim que o seu cliente compreende que valor deve ser escolhido."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:463
msgid "Max. redeem operations"
msgstr "Máx. de operações de validação"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:466
msgid ""
"How often do you allow to redeem the ticket? If you set it to 0, you can "
"redeem the ticket unlimited."
msgstr ""
"Quantas vezes permite validar o bilhete? Se definir como 0, o bilhete pode "
"ser validado ilimitadamente."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:472
msgid "Max. redeems per day"
msgstr "Máx. resgates por dia"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:475
msgid ""
"How often can the ticket be redeemed per day? 0 = unlimited (only total max "
"applies)."
msgstr ""
"Quantas vezes o bilhete pode ser resgatado por dia? 0 = ilimitado (apenas o "
"máximo total se aplica)."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:481
msgid "Print this on the ticket"
msgstr "Imprimir isto no bilhete"

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:482
msgid "This optional information will be displayed on the ticket detail page."
msgstr ""
"Esta informação opcional será apresentada na página de detalhe do bilhete "
"para o cliente."

#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:502
#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:840
msgid "Amount of ticket numbers per item sale"
msgstr "Quantidade de numeros de bilhete por venda de item"

